Source: proxmox-backup-client
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ciro Iriarte <ciro.iriarte+software@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 13~),
 gcc,
 clang,
 libclang-dev,
 pkgconf,
 pkg-config,
 xz-utils,
 libfuse3-dev,
 libssl-dev,
 libzstd-dev,
 libacl1-dev,
 libsystemd-dev,
 libcrypt-dev,
 uuid-dev,
 zstd
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://pbs.proxmox.com

Package: proxmox-backup-client
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, fuse3
Description: Proxmox Backup client (proxmox-backup-client, pxar)
 Command-line client for Proxmox Backup Server: create and restore
 deduplicated, encrypted backups with proxmox-backup-client, plus the
 pxar archive tool.
 .
 Community/unofficial build from upstream Rust sources.

Package: proxmox-backup-file-restore
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, fuse3, proxmox-backup-client (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Single-file restore for Proxmox Backup
 File-level restore from Proxmox Backup Server snapshots (host and
 container backups). The VM/block-image restore path is not included.
